      "message": "validation: set error upon mutated block in ConnectBlock\n\nIn order to avoid confusing partial override of error state,\nlog the old state and override it in ConnectBlock().\nWhen CheckBlock() returns an Invalid state due to a mutated block,\nthe error is upgraded to Error state. A new log entry prints the\nInvalid state, then it is overridden to an Error state.\nThe behavior change is that the reject reason was previously\nkept, now it is overwritten, and result and debug messages are reset.",
