      "message": "validation: don't re-report fatal error from DisconnectTip\n\nIn order to avoid confusing partial override of error state,\ndon't overwrite the error in ActivateBestChainStep().\nWhen DisconnectTip() returns an error state, the fatal error has\nalready been reported (by FlushStateToDisk()). Log it and return,\nwithout reporting a second, less specific fatal error.\nBehavior change: the duplicate fatalError notification is no longer\nemitted in this case.",
